---
sequenceDiagram
%% CQRS request pipeline: every use case returns a Result.
    participant Client
    participant Endpoint as Minimal-API Endpoint
    participant Sender as ISender (MediatR)
    participant Exc as ExceptionHandling behavior
    participant Log as RequestLogging behavior
    participant Val as Validation behavior
    participant Handler
    participant Store as Repository + IUnitOfWork / IDbConnectionFactory

    Client->>Endpoint: HTTP request
    Endpoint->>Sender: Send(command / query)
    Sender->>Exc: next()
    Exc->>Log: next()
    Log->>Val: next()
    alt validation fails
        Val-->>Sender: Result.Failure(ValidationError)
    else valid
        Val->>Handler: Handle(request)
        Handler->>Store: load / persist (write = EF, read = Dapper)
        Store-->>Handler: data / SaveChanges
        Handler-->>Val: Result<T>
    end
    Val-->>Sender: Result<T>
    Sender-->>Endpoint: Result<T>
    Endpoint-->>Client: result.Match(Ok, ApiResults.Problem)
